Open a radius 1 rift in spacetime at the targeted location for [3, 3, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns, increasing in radius by 1 each turn to a maximum of [1, 1, 2, 2, 2 (TL1-5)].

All caught within the rift are pulled towards the center and take [22, 29, 35, 40, 45 (TL1-5; SP 100)] gravity damage.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
